{"id":43184,"date":"2025-11-19T18:06:11","date_gmt":"2025-11-19T23:06:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/upwithwomenstg.wpengine.com\/?page_id=43184"},"modified":"2026-02-11T16:53:48","modified_gmt":"2026-02-11T21:53:48","slug":"changing-the-conversation","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/changing-the-conversation\/","title":{"rendered":"Changing the Conversation"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<script src=\"https:\/\/sky.blackbaudcdn.net\/static\/og-web-loader\/1\/main.js\" data-envid=\"p-TgxmhEmDUE2uYiVU86fBGw\" data-zone=\"can\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner has-animation-style2 has-text-animation-opacity\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__link\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1378\" height=\"535\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/financial_audit_img.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__image wp-block-getwid-banner__source wp-image-40802\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/financial_audit_img.jpg 1378w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/financial_audit_img-300x116.jpg 300w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/financial_audit_img-1024x398.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/financial_audit_img-768x298.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1378px) 100vw, 1378px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__caption\" style=\"min-height:450px\"><div style=\"max-width:1100px\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__caption-wrapper\"><span class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__title\">CHANGING THE CONVERSATION<\/span><p class=\"wp-block-getwid-banner__text\">Reframing poverty, homelessness, and gender-based violence in Canada<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-top-large getwid-padding-bottom-large getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium getwid-align-items-mobile-center getwid-reset-min-height-mobile\" style=\"min-height:60vh\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-grey-200-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\" style=\"opacity:0.75;background-color:#FFFFFF;mix-blend-mode:darken\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-page-title has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-40dfa244357d991a51432d20971ba2b7\">a new lens ON GENDERED POVERTY<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color\">Too often, poverty, homelessness, and gender-based violence are reduced to individual circumstances rather than understood as outcomes of the systemic inequities impacting women and gender-diverse people. These narratives shape collective understandings, obscuring both the underlying systems at play and the solutions needed to address them. Reframing the story enables us to confront the roots of gendered poverty and advance solutions toward a more just and equitable future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color\">We provide evidence-informed insights, expert commentary, and compelling client stories that showcase community-based, feminist-informed approaches. Our work restores agency, fosters resilience, and demonstrates how targeted interventions can drive lasting, meaningful change.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-584afefcac8d5c31968f34804cb26ef5 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color\">If you\u2019re looking to elevate the conversation with credible data, community-centred perspectives, and lived-experience storytelling, we can help.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-default has-custom-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>For media interviews and inquiries contact:<\/strong><br><br>Julie Shultz, Associate Director, Stakeholder Experience<br><strong>julie.s@upwithwomen.org<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium getwid-reset-min-height-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-custom-white-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:29px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-underline\">MEET FOUNDER AND CEO LIA GRIMANIS<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-margin-b\">Lia Grimanis turned her lived experiences of violence and homelessness into a mission: to help women and gender-diverse people rise from adversity.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e3d0882780d8d62a200bdaec86c30d86\">For Lia Grimanis, the mission of Up With Women\/Exponenti\u2019elles is personal. At just 16 years old, Lia found herself navigating homelessness after her grandmother \u2014 her primary caregiver \u2014 passed away. Fleeing violence and abuse at the hands of her remaining family members, Lia spent countless nights couch surfing.<br><br>Her challenges were only compounded by late-diagnosed autism, which made it harder to recognize escalating violence or danger until it was too late.<br>After a family member threatened to kill her, Lia called a hotline and was directed to a shelter for survivors of violence. Initially overwhelmed and struggling with thoughts of suicide, she made a promise to herself while lying on her shelter bed: to one day help other women in her position rebuild their lives. She quickly set to work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-custom-black-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/meet-founder-and-ceo-lia-grimanis\/\">READ LIA&#8217;S STORY<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box has-text-right has-mobile-layout-default has-mobile-alignment-default\"><div style=\"margin-left:35px\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box__image-container is-position-top\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box__image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1275\" height=\"750\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Lia-Pink-headshot.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box__image wp-image-42163\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Lia-Pink-headshot.jpg 1275w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Lia-Pink-headshot-300x176.jpg 300w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Lia-Pink-headshot-1024x602.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Lia-Pink-headshot-768x452.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1275px) 100vw, 1275px\" \/><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-image-box__content\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><em>\u201cMy entire life has become focused on that promise I made to myself in the shelter. And I want my story to inspire others to believe they can do it, too.\u201d<\/em><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2014Lia Grimanis, Founder and CEO, Up With Women\/Exponenti\u2019elles<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section is-style-default\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\" style=\"min-height:60vh\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-grey-200-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:52.63%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"h